WEBVTT

01:30.400 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:38.720 --> 01:40.680
He Xianwo actually hid so deep.

01:41.200 --> 01:42.920
Miss Gao was captured by him.

01:43.000 --> 01:44.840
He has two looks.

01:44.920 --> 01:46.360
He must be caught.

01:46.440 --> 01:47.720
-Yes.
-He must be caught.

01:47.800 --> 01:51.280
DECEASED FATHER
FU YUANTING'S MEMORIAL TABLET

02:03.920 --> 02:04.960
Lansheng.

02:06.520 --> 02:07.840
Lansheng.

02:13.560 --> 02:14.600
Bao.

02:15.320 --> 02:16.200
Why don't you come in?

02:23.920 --> 02:27.800
Are you my brother

02:30.560 --> 02:32.240
or uncle now?

02:36.120 --> 02:39.400
You shouldn't be affected
by the adults' business.

02:41.800 --> 02:43.320
I can still be your brother,

02:44.360 --> 02:45.280
but you can't call me uncle.

02:51.800 --> 02:54.520
You'll get hungry if you
don't eat all the time.

02:55.160 --> 02:59.200
My mom says when you're unhappy,
eat some dim sims,

02:59.280 --> 03:00.560
and you will feel a little sweet.

03:07.360 --> 03:08.640
No matter how unhappy I am,

03:10.160 --> 03:11.280
I have to face it

03:13.680 --> 03:15.080
and live with a smile.

03:16.680 --> 03:18.080
That's how my parents can rest assured.

03:23.320 --> 03:24.360
Lansheng.

03:25.440 --> 03:26.880
I am sorry.

03:27.480 --> 03:31.360
It was the Spirit Clan he brought
that killed your parents.

03:31.880 --> 03:33.160
I'm…

03:33.240 --> 03:36.920
I'm afraid you'll hate me.

03:46.960 --> 03:47.800
Bao.

03:49.120 --> 03:50.600
I am not a saint.

03:51.640 --> 03:52.960
I won't take revenge,

03:54.320 --> 03:56.480
but I really don't want
to see Jiang Li anymore.

03:57.640 --> 03:59.840
However, he and you are different people.

04:00.480 --> 04:01.680
I won't hate you.

04:05.600 --> 04:06.960
Lansheng.

04:07.040 --> 04:09.280
If you feel lonely alone,

04:09.360 --> 04:12.040
I will definitely
stay with you all the time.

04:12.880 --> 04:13.920
Okay.

04:16.040 --> 04:17.200
I've thought it over.

04:18.959 --> 04:21.079
I'll bring Qiumin back safely.

04:22.040 --> 04:24.640
There's so much I want to say
to her in person.

04:26.680 --> 04:27.600
Master.

04:30.200 --> 04:32.240
Master. We got news about Miss Gao.

04:34.840 --> 04:36.320
SKY HIGH AND GRAND

04:36.400 --> 04:37.480
Have you found Qiumin?

04:39.440 --> 04:40.840
We just got here.

04:40.920 --> 04:42.200
Greenview Heights got the message.

04:42.280 --> 04:43.760
The Immortal Alliance's wanted,

04:43.840 --> 04:45.000
and reward warrants
are all over the place.

04:45.080 --> 04:47.480
Early this morning,
a cultivator here reported

04:47.560 --> 04:50.280
that he saw He Xianwo
take Miss Gao to the Dark Abyss.

04:50.360 --> 04:52.240
Why die He Xianwo take her
to the Dark Abyss?

04:52.320 --> 04:53.880
We don't know why,

04:55.280 --> 04:56.840
but He Xianwo is a very calculating man,

04:57.440 --> 05:00.000
and everything he does
is well thought out.

05:00.600 --> 05:01.800
Now we know

05:01.880 --> 05:04.720
that he probably created
the three-way chaos on purpose.

05:05.640 --> 05:06.640
On the one hand,

05:06.720 --> 05:08.360
he took advantage of the chaos
to take Miss Gao captive,

05:09.000 --> 05:10.200
and on the other hand,

05:10.280 --> 05:11.480
he wanted to use
the power of the Immortal Alliance

05:12.160 --> 05:13.400
to seal the Dark Clan

05:13.480 --> 05:16.920
so that he could carry out his real plan
in the Dark Abyss.

05:17.000 --> 05:18.160
What is his real plan?

05:19.800 --> 05:22.800
He wants to use the Chaos Power
to open the Celestial Ladder

05:22.880 --> 05:23.920
and travel to the divine realm.

05:24.000 --> 05:27.720
So, He Xianwo thinks
Gao Qiumin is the Chaos Pearl?

05:27.800 --> 05:29.240
Gao Qiumin is the Chaos Pearl?

05:29.840 --> 05:31.360
What's going on?

05:32.760 --> 05:33.640
He was wrong.

05:34.320 --> 05:35.280
Gao Qiumin isn't,

05:35.880 --> 05:37.480
but if He Xianwo thinks so,

05:38.360 --> 05:39.200
does he

05:39.280 --> 05:41.360
want to use Gao Qiumin's power
to repair the Celestial Ladder?

05:41.960 --> 05:44.120
It was rumored that back in the day,
Emperor Zhao Ming plagued the world

05:45.280 --> 05:48.160
and even tried to kill the immortals,
making them angry.

05:48.240 --> 05:50.320
The Divine Clan didn't want
to protect the Humans anymore,

05:51.320 --> 05:52.640
so they cut off the Celestial Ladder.

05:53.360 --> 05:54.800
Then why does He Xianwo
think that with the Chaos Pearl

05:54.880 --> 05:56.400
he can fix the Celestial Ladder?

05:56.480 --> 05:58.360
Because it was the Chaos Pearl

05:59.080 --> 06:00.760
that cut off the Celestial Ladder.

06:02.440 --> 06:03.840
The ancient artifact.

06:04.640 --> 06:06.800
The Chaos Pearl. The Book of Fate.

06:07.880 --> 06:09.000
They appeared with
the creation of the world.

06:09.920 --> 06:12.160
One controls time and space,
the timekeeper.

06:12.240 --> 06:15.560
The other controls
cause and effect, the fate.

06:16.160 --> 06:17.680
They are the executors
of the Way of Heaven

06:18.440 --> 06:20.600
and are holier than the Divine Clan,

06:20.680 --> 06:22.600
but the Book of Fate
has never appeared in the world,

06:22.680 --> 06:24.400
so the only thing that He Xianwo

06:24.480 --> 06:26.840
can desire is the Chaos Pearl,
which has landed in the human realm.

06:26.920 --> 06:28.560
But I was in the Dark Abyss for ten years.

06:28.640 --> 06:31.080
I have never seen the remains
of the Celestial Ladder

06:31.600 --> 06:32.680
or heard mention of it.

06:34.280 --> 06:35.600
If the legend is true,

06:36.400 --> 06:39.760
the remains of the Celestial Ladder
must still contain the Chaos Power,

06:40.640 --> 06:42.840
which is capable of disrupting space-time

06:42.920 --> 06:45.880
and even collapsing or hiding it,

06:45.960 --> 06:48.600
so it makes sense that you didn't see it.

06:48.680 --> 06:49.720
Enough of this.

06:49.800 --> 06:51.200
I'm going to the Dark Abyss
to save Qiumin.

06:51.280 --> 06:52.360
Fu Lansheng.

06:52.440 --> 06:53.880
That's He Xianwo.

06:53.960 --> 06:55.280
Are you going to die alone?

06:55.360 --> 06:58.000
If He Xianwo knows
she's not the Chaos Pearl,

06:58.080 --> 06:59.680
he'll kill her.

06:59.760 --> 07:01.000
By then, it will be too late.

07:08.200 --> 07:09.040
If you're going,

07:09.880 --> 07:11.080
you'll have to bring leverage.

07:39.480 --> 07:40.840
What is this place?

07:42.040 --> 07:43.160
Why did you bring me here?

07:52.480 --> 07:56.360
I brought you here just to ask you
for a small favor.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.080
To lure the Chaos Pearl here.

07:59.000 --> 08:01.520
It's just a small favor,
so I thought you wouldn't say no.

08:02.440 --> 08:04.400
I don't understand what you're saying.

08:04.480 --> 08:06.120
What does the Chaos Pearl
have to do with me?

08:08.680 --> 08:10.880
I didn't expect you
to be so compassionate,

08:11.400 --> 08:13.040
but you're wrong about one thing.

08:14.520 --> 08:17.680
The more you cover up or hide for her,

08:18.200 --> 08:20.080
the more you expose the truth.

08:21.760 --> 08:24.840
The Chaos Pearl is Mu Xuanling.

08:28.840 --> 08:30.680
She's just one of the Spirit Clan,

08:31.200 --> 08:33.120
so how could she have
anything to do with the artifact?

08:33.880 --> 08:35.520
You seem to be overestimating her.

08:44.000 --> 08:45.360
Ten thousand years ago,

08:45.440 --> 08:47.720
the Celestial Ladder
was destroyed here by the Chaos Pearl.

08:47.800 --> 08:51.320
The ruins are filled with the Chaos Power

08:52.400 --> 08:54.320
that only the Chaos Pearl can resolve,

08:55.000 --> 08:58.920
and any mortal who enters
will be lost forever.

09:03.880 --> 09:04.880
Miss Gao,

09:04.960 --> 09:06.880
do you want to try?

09:09.920 --> 09:12.200
You're threatening me, aren't you?

09:13.720 --> 09:15.360
I told you

09:15.440 --> 09:18.160
Mu Xuanling is not the Chaos Pearl,
so she isn't.

09:19.800 --> 09:20.840
Miss Gao.

09:21.960 --> 09:24.880
I just want Mu Xuanling
to fix the Celestial Ladder for me.

09:25.640 --> 09:26.640
I'm not gonna hurt anybody.

09:26.720 --> 09:28.640
Not gonna hurt anybody?

09:30.800 --> 09:32.600
How many people
have been injured or killed

09:32.680 --> 09:34.560
in the war between these three clans?

09:34.640 --> 09:36.880
Isn't the life of the world a life?

09:38.560 --> 09:39.680
I also feel sorry.

09:41.800 --> 09:43.400
You're just verbally sorry.

09:44.480 --> 09:46.120
You'll do anything
and everything frantically

09:46.640 --> 09:49.160
to open the Celestial Ladder.

09:50.040 --> 09:51.840
What makes you want
to go to the Celestial Realm?

09:55.920 --> 09:57.440
I hear there's
a never-ending celestial spring

09:57.520 --> 09:59.360
at the Celestial Realm

10:00.160 --> 10:01.280
and that people, without labor

10:02.480 --> 10:04.920
and unhappiness,

10:05.760 --> 10:09.400
live forever with spiritual energy
from the human realm

10:11.440 --> 10:13.880
while the Humans experience
old age, sickness, and death.

10:13.960 --> 10:18.520
Even suffering from hunger
depends on the mercy of God.

10:21.720 --> 10:23.760
I would love to go to the Celestial Realm

10:23.840 --> 10:27.840
and see why things are so unfair.

10:31.600 --> 10:35.040
You set up the Decaying Immortal Pavilion
and caused chaos again and again.

10:35.120 --> 10:37.200
How much blood is on your hands?

10:38.200 --> 10:41.200
Now you come here
and pretend to be compassionate.

10:44.920 --> 10:47.120
It's been fun arguing with you,

10:48.040 --> 10:50.120
but I'm afraid we've run out of time

10:51.160 --> 10:52.480
because your friends are already here.

10:54.600 --> 10:55.800
Qiumin.

10:56.800 --> 10:57.960
Fu Lansheng.

10:58.920 --> 11:00.640
He Xianwo. Let her go.

11:00.720 --> 11:02.280
He's in league with Nan Xuyue.

11:02.360 --> 11:04.240
They have something up their sleeves.
Get out of here. Get out of here.

11:05.160 --> 11:07.000
Let her go. Get me.

11:07.720 --> 11:08.880
I'll be at your disposal.

11:10.040 --> 11:12.400
He Xianwo. It's me you want.

11:13.000 --> 11:14.080
Let her go.

11:14.640 --> 11:15.720
Let me take care of it.

11:15.800 --> 11:17.280
His sword is at her neck.

11:17.360 --> 11:20.320
No matter how fast your sword is,
you can't keep her safe.

11:22.120 --> 11:23.040
I'm the Chaos Pearl

11:23.920 --> 11:26.800
and the one who started this,
so I don't want to owe her.

11:34.760 --> 11:36.200
It is you I trust.

11:37.080 --> 11:38.920
Even if I'm captured by He Xianwo,

11:40.000 --> 11:43.560
you'll be able to get me out, right?

11:51.400 --> 11:52.480
Mu Xuanling.

11:52.560 --> 11:54.840
You and I are rivals,
so I've never liked you.

11:54.920 --> 11:56.640
Even if you come to replace me now,

11:57.400 --> 11:59.440
I won't be grateful to you. Not at all.

11:59.520 --> 12:00.760
Stop that nonsense.

12:01.360 --> 12:02.360
Do you think I like you?

12:03.080 --> 12:04.000
Piece of trash.

12:04.080 --> 12:05.840
How unlucky are you
that you're always being held hostage?

12:05.920 --> 12:07.920
I advise you to go back
and learn the escaping technique.

12:08.000 --> 12:09.120
If you can't beat someone, you can escape.

12:09.200 --> 12:10.360
Mu Xuanling.

12:13.480 --> 12:14.640
When I was little,

12:16.400 --> 12:17.880
you died for me,

12:21.320 --> 12:22.560
so I owe you.

12:24.640 --> 12:25.760
Today,

12:27.160 --> 12:28.840
-I want to pay you back.
-No.

12:31.200 --> 12:32.280
Qiumin.

12:35.640 --> 12:37.040
-Gao Qiumin.
-Qiumin.

12:48.320 --> 12:49.160
The Square Sword Array.

12:56.560 --> 12:57.480
You can't escape.

13:01.880 --> 13:04.760
You seem to have gotten cocky too soon.

13:05.480 --> 13:08.840
Gao Qiumin is stupid,
but she's right about one thing.

13:09.640 --> 13:11.440
Since I'm teaming up with Nan Xuyue,

13:11.960 --> 13:13.440
how can I not have something up my sleeve?

13:15.920 --> 13:18.400
Mr. Nan, it's your turn.

13:32.840 --> 13:34.120
Immortals Array?

13:36.040 --> 13:38.240
Nan Xuyue. You betrayed me?

13:40.680 --> 13:41.520
I've never been loyal to you,

13:43.080 --> 13:44.360
so how can I betray you?

13:47.360 --> 13:48.640
Six thousand years ago,

13:49.160 --> 13:51.280
the Immortal Alliance used
all the power of the Chaos Pearl

13:51.360 --> 13:52.920
to build the Immortals Array,

13:53.840 --> 13:55.720
and now, you only have the Chaos Pearl

13:56.360 --> 13:58.240
but not the Chaos Power,

13:58.320 --> 14:01.960
so rebuilding the Immortals Array
is just a pipe dream.

14:03.680 --> 14:05.000
A pipe dream?

14:06.760 --> 14:07.720
You were right.

14:07.800 --> 14:09.160
He is the evil cultivator

14:09.240 --> 14:11.680
that Feng Xiang and I met

14:11.760 --> 14:12.560
when we built
the Immortals Array 6,000 years ago.

14:12.640 --> 14:14.000
And he has really lived for so long.

14:15.520 --> 14:18.200
He was trying to seize the Chaos Pearl

14:18.280 --> 14:20.080
but was seriously injured
by my killing move.

14:20.760 --> 14:22.120
I thought he was dead,

14:22.200 --> 14:23.680
but according to you,

14:23.760 --> 14:25.120
it looks like he's faked
his own death to take refuge

14:25.200 --> 14:27.560
and survived all these years
by changing his face.

14:28.800 --> 14:29.880
However,

14:29.960 --> 14:32.640
why did you suspect
He Xianwo had lived long?

14:34.200 --> 14:35.800
He knows how to break the Immortals Array,

14:36.480 --> 14:39.480
so I'm guessing
that when you built it back then,

14:39.560 --> 14:41.560
he was probably snooping around

14:41.640 --> 14:43.440
and learning the key to the array.

14:43.520 --> 14:46.000
And not long ago,
he refined the Illusion Elixir.

14:46.640 --> 14:49.640
The Illusion Elixir's ingredient,
the Phoenix Herb,

14:49.720 --> 14:52.840
went extinct with the collapse
of Phoenix Mountain 6,000 years ago.

14:53.440 --> 14:54.960
It's true that he couldn't have gotten it

14:55.800 --> 14:59.720
if he hadn't existed
6,000 years ago or more.

15:02.040 --> 15:03.200
But what I am puzzled about is

15:03.280 --> 15:06.400
that even if a human cultivator
reaches the Spiritual Form stage,

15:06.480 --> 15:08.520
his lifespan is only
a thousand years at most.

15:08.600 --> 15:12.560
Feng Xiang paid such a huge price
to get immortality,

15:12.640 --> 15:14.680
but how come He Xianwo
can live for so many years?

15:14.760 --> 15:16.760
Has he also seen High Cyclic Divinity?

15:18.920 --> 15:19.760
I don't think so.

15:20.280 --> 15:23.240
You've seen what it takes to live forever,

15:24.120 --> 15:27.200
but I did once hear of an evil spell

15:27.800 --> 15:29.920
that sucks the blood and essence

15:30.480 --> 15:33.720
of others and uses their lives
to prolong one's own.

15:35.360 --> 15:38.280
The practitioner of this spell
extends their own life

15:38.360 --> 15:41.000
but suffers a great backlash.

15:41.800 --> 15:42.960
They look normal on the outside

15:43.040 --> 15:45.920
but rot like mud on the inside.

15:46.520 --> 15:48.160
Eventually, their bodies will explode,

15:48.240 --> 15:49.880
and they will die a doubly painful death.

15:49.960 --> 15:54.160
I think this guy has this evil skill.

15:54.760 --> 15:56.240
What on earth

15:57.800 --> 15:59.640
could make someone do that?

16:01.120 --> 16:01.960
Qian Guang.

16:04.120 --> 16:05.560
I have one more thing to ask.

16:05.640 --> 16:07.680
Today, the Dark Abyss is only sealed
by Sang Qi's spiritual essence.

16:07.760 --> 16:09.480
I'm afraid that won't last long,

16:10.000 --> 16:11.240
so I want to rebuild the Immortals Array,

16:12.160 --> 16:14.080
and I've read
all the ancient texts of my ancestors.

16:14.600 --> 16:16.400
The most important thing
is the Chaos Power,

16:16.480 --> 16:19.400
but the Chaos Pearl was exhausted
6,000 years ago,

16:19.920 --> 16:21.000
so is there any other way

16:21.080 --> 16:23.120
to rebuild the Immortals Array
without the Chaos Power?

16:30.480 --> 16:31.640
There is indeed a way

16:31.720 --> 16:35.360
to rebuild it without the Chaos Power.

16:35.440 --> 16:38.400
It requires
that the three most powerful men

16:38.480 --> 16:39.720
of spiritual power stand

16:39.800 --> 16:43.360
above the doors
of rehabilitation, life, and death

16:44.120 --> 16:45.360
to complete it.

16:47.640 --> 16:48.920
Thanks, Qian Guang.

16:51.000 --> 16:52.000
Don't thank me now.

16:52.800 --> 16:55.320
The Death Door is the place
where the calamity occurs.

16:55.920 --> 16:58.120
Without the power of the Chaos Pearl,

16:58.200 --> 16:59.840
those on the Death Door

16:59.920 --> 17:01.880
will die from the exhaustion
of their spiritual power.

17:04.040 --> 17:07.200
This is the only solution.

17:08.319 --> 17:09.319
In Snow City, Xuantian Sect,

17:09.400 --> 17:11.319
Mirage Palace, Jade Sky Palace,
and even the Dark Abyss,

17:12.200 --> 17:13.560
the older generation
of Saints in the Spiritual Form stage

17:13.640 --> 17:14.560
have fallen one after another,

17:15.160 --> 17:17.000
so the only strongest people
with spiritual power today

17:17.520 --> 17:20.880
are me, Mu Xuanling,

17:20.960 --> 17:23.480
and you.

17:24.160 --> 17:25.520
So, since then,

17:26.440 --> 17:27.880
I have not been plotting against you,

17:29.080 --> 17:31.080
and I have fallen into your trap.

17:31.160 --> 17:33.400
We can't predict your every plan,

17:33.480 --> 17:35.680
but we know what you want in the end.

17:36.600 --> 17:37.440
He Xianwo.

17:38.040 --> 17:39.480
The Death Door is for you.

17:40.360 --> 17:43.000
Working with Nan Xuyue
wasn't that difficult.

17:43.600 --> 17:44.800
Nan Xuyue.

17:45.520 --> 17:48.080
Do you really know what he is like

17:48.160 --> 17:50.320
or what he does behind the scenes?

17:58.320 --> 17:59.600
Why?

18:00.400 --> 18:02.080
A man who deserves to die

18:03.040 --> 18:06.680
but doesn't want to will struggle.

18:07.560 --> 18:11.080
He or she will make one wrong step
if wavering in that struggle,

18:12.080 --> 18:13.440
and then everything
will be wrong from there.

18:14.680 --> 18:16.040
That's what happened to me.

18:18.080 --> 18:19.360
It's irrefutable.

18:20.120 --> 18:22.040
Then why are you
suddenly telling me everything?

18:26.360 --> 18:27.680
This is He Xianwo's medicine.

18:29.320 --> 18:30.640
It renews my life

18:33.600 --> 18:34.960
but keeps me coerced

18:36.000 --> 18:37.600
and in control.

18:42.560 --> 18:44.560
Now I don't want to go on.

18:48.720 --> 18:52.240
There's a price to pay for wrongdoing.

18:54.040 --> 18:55.120
Kill me

19:00.120 --> 19:02.120
or let me do something for you

19:04.160 --> 19:05.920
before killing me.

19:08.800 --> 19:11.240
Nan Xuyue was coerced by me

19:12.120 --> 19:13.640
and in my control?

19:15.240 --> 19:16.200
Is that really true?

19:17.120 --> 19:20.360
You're going to die,
so go ahead and laugh.

19:20.440 --> 19:21.280
After you laugh,

19:21.360 --> 19:24.640
take all your sins to hell
and atone for them.

19:27.040 --> 19:28.240
Start the array.

19:45.040 --> 19:48.240
Your alliance is just fragile.

19:49.440 --> 19:51.120
Do you really think

19:51.640 --> 19:55.440
what Nan Xuyue did can be ignored
and dismissed as nothing?

19:55.520 --> 19:56.880
And you, Nan Xuyue?

19:57.480 --> 19:58.960
Can you really let her go?

20:01.040 --> 20:04.400
Isn't she the reason you want to live?

20:12.240 --> 20:14.160
This is my own business.

20:14.960 --> 20:16.080
I don't need you to worry about it.

20:25.360 --> 20:26.400
Nan Xuyue.

20:27.720 --> 20:28.600
Nan Xuyue, think carefully.

20:29.560 --> 20:32.360
If I die, you won't get the medicine,

20:33.400 --> 20:34.720
and you'll die too.

20:37.520 --> 20:38.800
Finally,

20:41.000 --> 20:41.920
everyone's in.

20:45.960 --> 20:48.040
-Everyone?
-Nan Xuyue.

20:48.920 --> 20:49.760
Open the array.

20:51.040 --> 20:52.120
OK.

20:54.200 --> 20:55.800
As you wish.

21:00.520 --> 21:01.760
No.

21:19.040 --> 21:21.240
Nan Xuyue. What are you doing?

21:24.440 --> 21:25.480
The array has been activated.

21:26.280 --> 21:29.040
No one in the array can escape.

21:29.680 --> 21:31.720
All three doors are death,

21:33.080 --> 21:34.360
so all three

21:35.640 --> 21:36.520
will be dead.

21:41.760 --> 21:43.680
What a great play.

21:44.280 --> 21:45.280
Nan Xuyue.

21:46.120 --> 21:47.640
Do you want to kill her too?

21:49.120 --> 21:50.720
What are you planning?

22:03.440 --> 22:04.480
Xuanling.

22:36.800 --> 22:38.840
I love you.

23:19.960 --> 23:21.400
It is you I trust.

23:21.920 --> 23:24.000
Even if I'm captured by He Xianwo,

23:25.080 --> 23:28.920
you'll be able to get me out, right?

23:36.640 --> 23:37.840
Xuanling.

23:40.000 --> 23:41.040
Xuanling.

23:45.120 --> 23:46.120
No.

23:49.560 --> 23:50.680
Mu Xuanling.

23:51.840 --> 23:53.160
Mu Xuanling.

24:01.240 --> 24:02.320
No.

24:03.360 --> 24:05.000
It shouldn't be like this.

24:10.000 --> 24:13.640
Whose lover always calls the other

24:14.160 --> 24:16.120
by the full name like you do?

24:16.920 --> 24:19.880
Call me Ling from now on, okay?

24:21.920 --> 24:22.960
Okay.

24:23.560 --> 24:24.440
Okay.

24:25.440 --> 24:26.800
As you wish.

24:36.840 --> 24:37.680
Why?

24:39.320 --> 24:40.760
Why is it like this?

24:41.440 --> 24:43.440
I heard everything

24:44.800 --> 24:46.360
you said to Xuanxin.

24:47.520 --> 24:49.920
Do you really want to work with Nan Xuyue?

24:51.040 --> 24:52.800
You know he can't be trusted.

24:57.440 --> 24:59.320
To rebuild the Immortals Array,

25:00.760 --> 25:04.400
it must be activated and opened
by an array builder.

25:05.760 --> 25:07.160
In all the world,

25:07.960 --> 25:09.720
Nan Xuyue is the only one who can do it,

25:10.880 --> 25:12.080
so I have no choice.

25:12.160 --> 25:14.400
What if he's got
something else up his sleeve?

25:15.480 --> 25:16.920
From the moment I made the plan,

25:18.320 --> 25:20.120
I put my own life on the line.

25:23.000 --> 25:24.040
Xuanxin,

25:25.240 --> 25:26.400
if I die,

25:26.480 --> 25:28.920
you will be the next leader
of the Immortal Alliance.

25:29.440 --> 25:33.920
I hope this sudden request
won't give you a hard time.

25:37.360 --> 25:39.040
But what about Miss Mu?

25:46.080 --> 25:49.920
She has a jade token from Nan Xuyue.

25:51.200 --> 25:52.560
I checked that,

25:53.960 --> 25:55.600
and it's a protective treasure.

25:56.120 --> 25:57.280
As long as it's there,

25:58.240 --> 25:59.800
Xuanling won't die.

26:00.880 --> 26:01.800
I mean,

26:04.120 --> 26:05.760
if you die,

26:06.920 --> 26:10.080
how will Miss Mu
spend the rest of her life?

26:19.600 --> 26:20.760
Mu Xuanling

26:22.000 --> 26:24.200
was born in the human realm
and raised in the Dark Abyss.

26:25.600 --> 26:28.040
The world has never been kind to her,

26:29.760 --> 26:31.880
but with her will,

26:31.960 --> 26:34.520
she has made her way through injustice

26:35.040 --> 26:38.040
and crushed all the pain
and humiliation under her feet.

26:39.400 --> 26:41.440
She is never attached to me.

26:42.400 --> 26:43.560
She is what she is.

26:45.120 --> 26:46.040
Her life will not be dimmed

26:47.160 --> 26:51.600
or rendered meaningless by my death.

26:53.360 --> 26:57.040
I loved her, honored her,
and believed in her,

26:58.520 --> 27:02.160
but those who live

27:03.760 --> 27:05.960
often suffer more than those who die.

27:07.160 --> 27:08.680
I will become so selfish

27:09.960 --> 27:12.040
that I'll make her the one who survived.

27:18.040 --> 27:20.960
In every battle, you're prepared to die.

27:22.960 --> 27:25.160
You always think of everyone

27:26.000 --> 27:27.960
but yourself.

27:29.720 --> 27:30.840
Xie Xuechen.

27:31.840 --> 27:33.120
You're so stupid.

27:34.040 --> 27:35.720
You have a heart of gold,

27:36.840 --> 27:40.640
and you need someone to care about you,

27:42.480 --> 27:44.520
so let me,

27:45.040 --> 27:47.280
a demon girl, die.

27:48.680 --> 27:49.880
I'm sorry.

27:51.640 --> 27:55.320
You should be the one to survive.

28:01.000 --> 28:02.160
Xie Xuechen.

28:04.720 --> 28:05.880
This time,

28:07.800 --> 28:11.360
let me protect you, okay?

28:23.720 --> 28:25.600
It should have been me who took the hit.

28:27.320 --> 28:28.360
No.

28:29.360 --> 28:30.440
You won't die.

28:31.160 --> 28:32.400
I won't let you die.

28:38.040 --> 28:39.120
Xuanling.

28:48.480 --> 28:49.560
Xuanling.

28:59.600 --> 29:00.680
Xuanling.

29:05.640 --> 29:06.960
Mu Xuanling.

29:25.760 --> 29:27.080
It shouldn't be like this.

29:28.560 --> 29:29.600
Mu Xuanling.

29:33.360 --> 29:34.480
The disciples of Jade Sky Palace

29:34.560 --> 29:36.600
are already spreading
the word about Gao Qiumin,

29:36.680 --> 29:38.720
but have you really decided

29:38.800 --> 29:40.800
to take the opportunity
of the Immortals Array being rebuilt

29:40.880 --> 29:43.320
to kill He Xianwo and Xie Xuechen?

29:44.600 --> 29:46.400
One has no regard for the lives of others,

29:47.560 --> 29:49.240
and the other has no regard for his own.

29:50.000 --> 29:52.360
The people she hates and loves

29:53.400 --> 29:55.240
are putting her in danger,

29:56.560 --> 29:57.960
so they both have to die.

29:58.640 --> 30:00.200
But she's also in the array.

30:00.280 --> 30:01.760
The Immortals Array is hard to change,

30:01.840 --> 30:04.440
so if you change it, all three will die,

30:04.520 --> 30:05.920
including her.

30:06.600 --> 30:08.400
My jade token will protect her.

30:09.760 --> 30:10.880
And the cost?

30:10.960 --> 30:13.440
It's a thing that can withstand
Immortals Array's Death Door,

30:13.520 --> 30:15.000
so what price will you pay?

30:18.080 --> 30:21.800
Nothing more than transferring
the damage she'll have to me.

30:22.600 --> 30:23.680
Then you will die.

30:29.480 --> 30:32.520
After killing He Xianwo,
I won't live long,

30:33.280 --> 30:36.440
and after I kill Xie Xuechen,
she'll hate me,

30:39.000 --> 30:40.000
so no matter how you think about it,

30:40.080 --> 30:42.800
the one who deserves
to die the most is me.

30:44.680 --> 30:45.920
I had said

30:46.440 --> 30:50.240
that if one day I hurt Xie Xuechen,
she could kill me.

30:51.400 --> 30:55.280
Since I promised her, I would do it,

30:56.560 --> 30:58.360
so I could die with Xie Xuechen

30:59.960 --> 31:01.560
and give her back her life.

31:01.640 --> 31:03.760
I truly realized today

31:04.640 --> 31:07.760
that you are not sober or predictable.

31:08.280 --> 31:11.360
You're only successful
because you're a madman.

31:11.440 --> 31:13.000
A daredevil madman.

31:20.320 --> 31:21.400
Mu Xuanling.

31:25.880 --> 31:26.760
Mu Xuanling.

31:27.680 --> 31:31.080
If you come any closer,
I'll kill you right now.

31:33.680 --> 31:34.640
Mu Xuanling.

31:36.800 --> 31:37.880
Jun Tian.

31:38.640 --> 31:39.480
Kill him.

31:41.240 --> 31:42.360
Mu Xuanling.

31:43.520 --> 31:44.800
Mu Xuanling.

32:57.920 --> 32:59.120
The Celestial Ladder.

33:06.000 --> 33:06.840
What does this mean?

33:06.920 --> 33:07.880
This is the Lava Chasm of the Dark Abyss.

33:08.600 --> 33:09.560
Where is Master?

33:09.640 --> 33:10.520
Sir.

33:10.600 --> 33:12.440
Master asked us to get
you out of Jade Sky Palace,

33:12.960 --> 33:14.160
but why have you brought us here?

33:22.160 --> 33:23.120
Guys.

33:23.720 --> 33:25.960
Master told me through this token

33:26.640 --> 33:28.120
to bring all the Spirit Clan
from the Decaying Immortal Pavilion

33:28.200 --> 33:29.040
to assemble here.

33:29.120 --> 33:32.920
He said he'd take us all
to a land free of worry,

33:34.280 --> 33:35.320
A land free of worry?

33:35.400 --> 33:36.400
-Great!
-Great!

33:36.480 --> 33:37.640
-Great!
-Great!

33:47.200 --> 33:48.280
Now, it's time

33:49.480 --> 33:51.800
for you to lend me some of your power.

34:00.440 --> 34:01.760
My power.

34:08.800 --> 34:09.960
-My power.
-Master.

34:10.040 --> 34:11.239
Why?

34:31.400 --> 34:32.480
Xie Xuechen.

34:38.280 --> 34:40.360
Jade Vault Technique. It was Xie Xuechen.

34:40.440 --> 34:42.760
Master was trying to kill us.
Xie Xuechen saved us.

34:42.840 --> 34:44.679
A human saved us.

34:46.880 --> 34:50.159
I have suffered for 10,000 years
and sacrificed so many lives

34:50.679 --> 34:53.920
to open the Celestial Ladder
and become immortal.

34:54.440 --> 34:57.640
In your opinion, what is the Divine Clan?

35:01.200 --> 35:04.280
In the past, the Divine Clan was above all
and ruled the three worlds.

35:05.680 --> 35:08.160
They disregarded all people

35:08.240 --> 35:10.160
and caused endless suffering
to the human realm.

35:11.800 --> 35:13.640
At that time,
the Humans had no spiritual channel

35:13.720 --> 35:15.120
and could not cultivate,

35:15.800 --> 35:17.880
so they could only pray
for the Divine Clan's favor

35:17.960 --> 35:20.800
and be enslaved by the Divine Clan
unknowingly,

35:23.840 --> 35:25.200
but 10,000 years ago,

35:25.720 --> 35:28.240
there appeared the only humans
who could cultivate spiritual power,

35:28.320 --> 35:30.760
who was honored by the world as a saint

35:30.840 --> 35:32.840
and worshiped as the Emperor.

35:36.120 --> 35:37.120
My mother said that

35:37.200 --> 35:39.800
when you go to heaven,
you can't go home again.

35:39.880 --> 35:41.720
Is it necessary to be sad?

35:41.800 --> 35:44.320
It's a great honor for the family
to be chosen as Servant of Immortals.

35:44.400 --> 35:45.240
It's a good thing.

35:45.840 --> 35:48.640
A Servant of Immortals
would be sacrificed, so we'd die.

35:48.720 --> 35:49.880
Don't be ridiculous.

35:49.960 --> 35:50.880
It's not death.

35:50.960 --> 35:52.640
We'll just leave our physical bodies

35:52.720 --> 35:54.640
and go to the Celestial Realm
to serve the gods.

35:54.720 --> 35:55.960
Don't talk.

35:56.640 --> 36:00.200
The Holy Lord commands us
to take good care of these children.

36:00.280 --> 36:01.120
Yes.

36:01.200 --> 36:02.880
FORTUNE RESIDENCE

36:02.960 --> 36:05.800
Does the Holy Lord want us to die?

36:07.520 --> 36:08.800
Don't misunderstand him, boy.

36:09.400 --> 36:11.440
The Holy Lord was born into
the favor of the Way of Heaven,

36:11.520 --> 36:13.120
so he shouldn't be tainted
by this mortal world,

36:13.200 --> 36:15.440
but in the ten years
I've been with the Holy Lord,

36:16.240 --> 36:19.080
he's worked every day
for ordinary people like you and me.

36:19.680 --> 36:23.960
Hasn't your village
been under his protection and favor?

36:24.560 --> 36:27.400
Even the Holy Lord has his difficulties,

36:28.120 --> 36:29.480
but we have to believe

36:29.560 --> 36:31.440
that he will give us
the best in the world.

36:31.520 --> 36:32.760
Later, however,

36:32.840 --> 36:34.880
the Holy Lord rebelled
against the Way of Heaven

36:34.960 --> 36:37.560
and ascended the Celestial Ladder
to kill the Divine Clan,

36:37.640 --> 36:40.040
but he ultimately lost
and was rejected by the world.

36:40.120 --> 36:43.280
I admire him
for his ambition and arrogance.

36:43.360 --> 36:46.000
I admire him for his courage and strength

36:46.080 --> 36:49.480
as a mere mortal who dared to challenge
the entire Divine Clan on his own.

36:49.560 --> 36:50.440
What I want

36:50.520 --> 36:53.040
is the destruction
of the entire evil Divine Clan.

36:53.120 --> 36:54.600
Otherwise, sooner or later,

36:54.680 --> 36:56.160
they'll come back to the human realm.

36:56.240 --> 37:00.280
I'm killing to protect more people.

37:01.160 --> 37:03.360
Is… Is that the Divine?

37:10.280 --> 37:11.960
Where is the Servant of Immortals?

37:14.520 --> 37:16.000
There will be no Servant of Immortals.

37:16.520 --> 37:17.640
Zhao Ming.

37:17.720 --> 37:19.760
Do you want to go
against the Way of Heaven?

37:19.840 --> 37:21.520
What the Divine Clan did
was not righteous.

37:21.600 --> 37:23.120
Today,

37:23.200 --> 37:25.880
I want there to be
only the sun and the moon

37:26.400 --> 37:27.960
without immortals.

37:43.360 --> 37:46.400
THE SQUARE OF THE DIVINE CLAN

37:47.440 --> 37:48.480
That's impossible.

37:51.320 --> 37:53.680
The Emperor fell
before he killed the Divine Clan.

37:54.200 --> 37:55.800
I saw it with my own eyes.

37:58.200 --> 37:59.680
How can there be no immortals?

38:06.720 --> 38:08.920
What happened here 10,000 years ago?

38:10.240 --> 38:11.320
Why is this happening?

38:14.160 --> 38:15.200
Why?

38:26.480 --> 38:27.760
Holy light.

38:30.680 --> 38:31.800
There must be an immortal.

38:33.040 --> 38:34.480
There must be an immortal.

39:16.280 --> 39:17.720
The Book of Fate.

39:35.880 --> 39:37.840
Evil cultivators
are not tolerated by the world,

39:38.440 --> 39:41.440
so, every hundred years,
they change their identity and appearance

39:42.200 --> 39:43.880
to survive.

39:49.120 --> 39:50.000
I didn't realize

39:51.760 --> 39:53.280
you still remembered me.

39:55.640 --> 39:58.360
The book controls fate and knows Karma.

39:59.360 --> 40:00.760
It's true to its name.

40:07.120 --> 40:08.800
Zhao Ming, the evil emperor,

40:09.920 --> 40:13.920
rebelled and killed the immortals
but became a demon

40:15.440 --> 40:17.120
and was sealed in the Lava Chasm.

40:28.480 --> 40:29.600
EMPEROR ZHAO MING

40:30.440 --> 40:31.760
PEARL

40:32.600 --> 40:33.480
THE EMPEROR AFRAID, TO KILL HUMAN KIDS
DESTROYED THE ORACLE AND BANNED SACRIFICES

40:34.080 --> 40:35.240
IMMORTALS BEWITCHED LIVING BEINGS
IMMORTALS KILLED FOR PEACE OF HUMANS

40:37.520 --> 40:38.560
It's…

40:39.640 --> 40:40.680
It's fake.

40:42.920 --> 40:44.120
It's all fake.

40:48.360 --> 40:49.360
The world is fake.

40:49.440 --> 40:50.760
The legends are fake.

40:50.840 --> 40:52.240
You're lying.

40:52.320 --> 40:53.880
The Book of Fate is lying.

40:54.480 --> 40:55.400
It's a 10,000-year lie.

40:55.480 --> 40:56.960
This is the truth.

41:01.160 --> 41:03.040
Zhao Ming is not guilty.

41:04.200 --> 41:06.040
Zhao Ming is not guilty.

41:10.600 --> 41:11.920
Not guilty.
